                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202003/2020032314140604.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>18</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日上午，由市教育局二级调研员杨涛带队，市教育局安监处、专职督学和市疾控中心等有关领导专家组成的督导检查组，通过听介绍、查痕迹、看现场、问情况等途径，对我校疫情防控和师生返校准备工作进行了深入细致检查。<U>检查组高度肯定了我校抓防疫、优教学、备返校等工作，认为防控措施科学精准，防控工作严谨扎实、成效显著，返校准备工作周全细致、稳妥得当，线上教学井然有序、质优效好，全校教师齐心合力，党员教师先锋模范带头作用发挥显著。</U></SPAN><U><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></U></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202003/2020032314143203.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">校党委书记、校长、防疫工作领导小组组长王琛介绍了近段时间来学校坚决贯彻、严格执行市教育局的各项防疫工作部署的整体情况；党委副书记、纪委书记孙洪亮解说了学校根据疫情变化制定的各项<U>师生返校准备工作</U>。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202003/2020032314144607.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">党政办、安全处、总务处等职能处室<U>从组织保障、制度预案制定、应急预案及各项工作演练、环境消毒、卫生清洁、师生进校及晨午检、就餐、住宿等各个环节准备工作向督查组作了详细汇报，</U>并引导督查组到教室、食堂、宿舍、体育场馆等进行实地踏看。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在听取汇报、查看台账和实地踏看后，督查组对学校部署落实疫情防控和开学准备等工作进行了深入点评。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202003/2020032314150124.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">杨<U>调研员</U>表示，学校按照教育部‘五个一律’的要求，严格落实了市教育局各项防控措施和责任，校园安全有序，广大党员和全体教师众志成城、科学应对，切实维护了师生生命安全和校园安全稳定。这段时间以来，<U>学校教师积极参与线上教学，战“疫”帮扶、捐款、献血等爱心志愿行动，展现了全校教师合力抗“疫”良好精神面貌和党员教师先锋模范作用。</U></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">杨<U>调研员</U>强调，<U>师生返校准备</U>、师生安全是这段时间工作的重中之重，目前学校领导班子和各职能处室要继续做实做好疫情防控的各项工作，精准摸排统计、严把学校进口关，积极做好返校和开学后各种情况的分析研判，同时要继续关注提升学生线上教学效果，进一步加强校园管理，保护好师生生命安全，确保返校工作<U>稳妥</U>有序。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">市教育局安监处罗立新处长和市疾控中心有关领导、专家还就疫情防控工作在更精准、更细致落实层面提出了宝贵的改进意见和建议。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">王琛表示，学校将积极吸取宝贵意见建议，进一步提标提质，以昂扬的精神面貌扎实落实“两手硬、两战赢”工作要求，确保学校疫情防控、返校后准备工作万无“疫”失、优质高效。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 322pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 23.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">党政办</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
